  she's beautiful she's talented it's just  going to be  she's going to kill it and people are  going to be  like well  welcome to the team baby but when it  comes to his two younger kids the sweet  girl star told et last august why he's  not so sure about them getting into the  family business  you and your lovely wife some incredible  acting jeans could you put them in one  of your movies one day would you say oh  man one of them wants to do it i'm not a  fan and i don't want  them them too but uh  i don't know i'll try with my i'll try  my damn just to keep them out of it  but you don't you love it  i love storytelling i love back to  filmmaking so i mean i like you know  directing and filmmaking but  um i just  i want them to you know go for other  things you know i want them to really to  go for other things and if they want to  maybe  but i i don't want them to get into  acting it's very hard it's very hard  it's very hard on people and uh  you know i don't want them to have that  kind of pressure i'm tough enough to  handle it but i wouldn't want to put  someone i love  into that well it sounds like you might  be doing more producing and directing  one day do you want to head in that  direction yeah well i've been directing  for a while now so it's been uh it's  been a passion that you know i'd rather  see the full project than just being the  one piece of it but  it's nice also just being the actor so  i'm happy i can be full  [Music]
 

